WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
Let's find out how to use Amazon audiences in your Sponsored display campaigns.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:08.708
Say you're looking to surface your line of sustainably-made coffee makers to eco-conscious

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.280
coffee fans.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.480
In your campaign, pick audiences as your targeting strategy.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.480
Then, pick Amazon audiences.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:20.140
There are four audience segments, lifestyle audiences like green and environmentally conscious,

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:25.760
interests like coffee lovers, life events like recently moved, and in market audiences,

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.260
to engage audiences shopping for similar items like pour-over coffee makers.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.715
You can search for

00:00:31.715 --> 00:00:34.260
segments or keep clicking to expand them.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:37.260
Simply click Add to include them in your targeting.
